WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Meet DeepsGuard360, an integrated security management platform for Papua New Guinea and the Pacific.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Manage guards, schedules, patrols, incidents and client reporting in one connected workspace.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Each security firm gets its own private workspace, with a master administration layer for the platform owner.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Scale from 50 guards to 150, 300 or a custom enterprise workforce.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
DeepsGuard360. One Platform. Complete Security Operations.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Developed and powered by Deeps Systems. Demo data and field activity are simulated.
